#   Wi-Fi/Marlin race at boot (OFFLINE PASS/HW PENDING) and accumulates V88.
# * Historical status at V67: Android 10 BOOTS to the launcher; Mali-400 GPU (GLES2) HW OK; audio OK;
#   WiFi 2.4GHz + internet OK; power button (WAKE) and software video (SPRD HW codecs
#   disabled for ABI 5.1) applied in V55. V62 fixes the keylayout parser of the
#   POWER button. V63 validated full late_resume but oscillates due to the suspend attempts
