#   V66 revealed that HWC1 does not load. V67 implements FBIOBLANK in the HWC2OnFbAdapter actually
#   used and coordinates fb_blank with early/late resume. Physical PASS: normal and fast OFF/ON,
#   touch recovered, stable final state and no late power-off.
#   5GHz not supported (hardware). Real 8GB storage (data ~4.7GB). boot=dd2d8154 (V53).

