## V66 package (HWC1 power-mode -> panel; boot-only) [HARDWARE: NO EFFECT, PATH NOT USED]
# V64 works physically, but the real OFF waited 1-3.4s for early_suspend. SurfaceFlinger
# already sends SPRD_FB_SET_POWER_MODE immediately; the stock kernel only recorded it. V66
# runs OFF/ON synchronously. ON cancels the pending legacy request or queues late_resume
# if the handlers already started, also covering fast OFF->ON without a stale OFF worker.
