## V54 package (WiFi step 11 -- netd RTNH_F_ONLINK; fix "connection without internet") [integrated in V55]
# V53 left WiFi FUNCTIONAL (scan, association, DHCP -> IP). But "no internet": the default
# route was not installed (netd addRoute gateway -> ENETUNREACH) because the 3.10 kernel
# requires ONLINK on gatewayed routes. CONFIRMED: with `ip route add default ... onlink` ping
# 8.8.8.8 + DNS work. V54 patches netd RouteController (rtm_flags=RTNH_F_ONLINK with
# nexthop). system.img only; boot = V53 (dd2d8154). Cumulative. 5GHz: not supported (chip
# sc2331 only 2.4GHz). Detail: results/fase-6/v52-v53-v54-wifi.md.
