## V48 package (WiFi step 5 -- insmod treats EEXIST as success; driver already loaded) [integrated in V49]
# V47 gave full caps -> the HAL loads sprdwl and wlan0 exists, but it retried insmod and
# finit_module returned EEXIST (module already loaded) -> Failed to start vendor HAL. V48
