## V47 package (WiFi step 4 -- remove the HAL capabilities line; real finit_module fix) [integrated in V48]
# V46 (user root) was NOT enough: the HAL still had CapEff=0 (root but zero caps) because the
# `capabilities` line on kernel 3.10 (no ambient) CLEARS all cap sets.
# V47 removes that line -> root keeps all caps -> finit_module loads sprdwl.
# system.img only; boot = V45 (f8a355e5). Cumulative. Same lesson as logd V22-V24.
