## V37 package (PHASE 6.3 -- dalvik.vm.usejit=false; JIT SIGSEGV fix on kernel 3.10) [integrated in V38]
# With V36, hwservicemanager is now STABLE (running, no signal 11); system_server starts
# and advances to PackageManager, but crashed in the "Jit thread pool" thread
# (SIGSEGV SEGV_ACCERR) because ART's JIT uses memfd_create (kernel >=3.17) and the SoC
# runs kernel 3.10 -> zygote restart loop. V37 disables the JIT (interpreter+AOT).
